        "original_id": "9b3099c7-1a77-57ca-b3c2-a6a2c96eea10",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luca Cordero di Montezemolo\n- Companies: Ferrari, Fiat S.p.A., Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV\n- Organizations: Confindustria, FIEG\n- Places: Turin, Netherlands\n- Roles: Chairman, President, businessman\n\nFacts:\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was born on 31 August 1947 and is an Italian businessman.\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was formerly Chairman of Ferrari and formerly Chairman of Fiat S.p.A..\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was also President of Confindustria and FIEG.\n- Fiat S.p.A. was an Italian holding company whose original and core activities were in the automotive industry.\n- Fiat S.p.A. stood for \"Fabbrica Italiana Automobili Torino,\" meaning Italian Automobile Factory of Turin.\n- On 29 January 2014, Fiat S.p.A. announced that it would merge into a new Netherlands-based holding company, Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV.\n- Fiat S.p.A. was succeeded by Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV, and the merger took place before the end of 2014.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
